OL,3,GNEWSAMP calls for 'failing' rail firm
OL,4,Ato lose contract
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn MP has called on the government to
OL,7,Ftransfer operation of a "failing" rail
OL,8,Fcompany's service to the planned Great
OL,9,FBritish Railways (GBR).
OL,11,FLee Barron, Labour MP for Corby and
OL,12,FEast Northamptonshire, wrote to the
OL,13,Ftransport secretary over his
OL,14,Fconstituents' complaints about the
OL,15,Freliability of East Midlands Railway's
OL,16,F(EMR) services.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,367,360,200,160,0,100
PN,36602
SC,0002
