OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSAMP calls for 'failing' rail firm
OL,4,Ato lose contract
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said: "This service is failing, and
OL,7,Fmy constituents are consistently in
OL,8,Ftouch with my office to share their
OL,9,Ftestimonies of being left stranded and
OL,10,Fout of pocket by cancelled services in
OL,11,FLondon or in neighbouring Kettering."
OL,13,FAn EMR spokesperson said: "We recognise
OL,14,Fthat recent performance has fallen
OL,15,Fbelow the standard we, and our
OL,16,Fcustomers, expect."
